    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Bug Type: Functional / AI Behavior (Exploit)<br/>
Priority: High</p>

<p>Preconditions:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Game is running, Miya is selected.</li>
	<li>Player is on an even floor (Floor 2, 4…) and has entered the Orc Rider Boss room.</li>
</ul>


<p>Steps to Reproduce:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Select Miya and start the game.</li>
	<li>Reach the Boss room (Orc Rider) and enter it.</li>
	<li>Move Miya to the affected corner of the room <span class="error">&#91;bổ sung vị trí cụ thể, ví dụ góc trên-trái&#93;</span>.</li>
	<li>Stay in that corner and shoot arrows at the boss with the left mouse button.</li>
	<li>Observe the boss’s behavior until it dies.</li>
</ol>


<p>Expected Result:</p>

<ul>
	<li>The boss chases Miya and uses its dash and hammer-spin attacks (TC-BS-07, 08, 09).</li>
	<li>The player cannot kill the boss without taking part in the fight.</li>
</ul>


<p>Actual Result:</p>

<ul>
	<li>The boss stays in place and does not chase Miya.</li>
	<li>It only plays idle animations and a red circle effect around itself, and never reaches Miya.</li>
	<li>Miya kills the boss with arrows without taking any damage.</li>
	<li>The boss then disappears (dies) normally.</li>
</ul>


<p>Test Case Result:</p>

<ul>
	<li>FAIL</li>
	<li>Related Test Cases: TC-BS-07 (Orc Rider stats and behavior), TC-BS-08 (dash attack), TC-BS-09 (hammer spin)</li>
</ul>


<p>Notes:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Likely a pathfinding or collision issue at that corner. Please check whether the boss gets stuck on a wall or obstacle, or whether the target position is unreachable.</li>
	<li>Verify whether the same exploit works with other characters and in the Necromancer boss room.</li>
	<li>Side observation: each arrow shows -1 damage on the boss, while TC-MI-01 and TC-MI-03 expect Miya’s damage to be 2. Please confirm whether the boss has damage reduction or this is a separate bug.</li>
	<li>Attach the screen recording <tt>Screen_Recording_2026-11-01_220133.mp4</tt>.</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
